OL,3,ACaptain in custody after boat capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus, local leader says,
OL,5,Aas eight reported dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe captain and seven crew of a
OL,8,Fpassenger boat that capsized near
OL,9,Fnorthern Cyprus have been taken into
OL,10,Fcustody, the local leader says
OL,12,FAccording to Cypriot and Turkish media,
OL,13,Fthe death toll has risen to eight, as
OL,14,Femergency services continue to search
OL,15,Ffor missing passengers
OL,17,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,18,Fself-declared Turkish Republic of
OL,19,FNorthern Cyprus, says search and rescue
OL,20,Foperations will continue
OL,21,F"uninterrupted" until all victims are
OL,22,Ffound
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
