OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACaptain in custody after boat capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus, local leader says,
OL,5,Aas eight reported dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were 267 people on the boat when
OL,8,Fit capsized, according to Ustel, and in
OL,9,Fan earlier update he said 237 had been
OL,10,Frescued, although the current figure is
OL,11,Funclear
OL,13,FThe boat left from the northern Cypriot
OL,14,Fport of Kyrenia at 11:58 local time
OL,15,F(09:58 BST) and officials say it
OL,16,Fcapsized around four nautical miles
OL,17,Finto its journey to Turkey
OL,19,FCyprus has been physically divided
OL,20,Fsince Turkey's 1974 invasion, with UN
OL,21,Fsoldiers patrolling a buffer zone known
OL,22,Fas the Green Line
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
